+One test is ignored: it asks a real endpoint a question whose transcript states the answer. Start an OpenAI-compatible server that reports log-probabilities, then run the test from the workspace root, naming the server and the model it serves:
+
+```sh
+DOMHRINGR_JUDGE_ENDPOINT=http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1 DOMHRINGR_JUDGE_MODEL=<model> \
+  mise exec -- cargo nextest run -p domhringr-judge-oracle --run-ignored only
+```
+
+A server that needs a key reads it from `DOMHRINGR_JUDGE_KEY`; the key is never written to the tree.
+
 ## The laws
 
 A judge classifies evidence and never adds to it.
